    "# Multimodal Cancer Classification Challenge 2026 — v41 (v19 + stacked lecture-aligned tweaks)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Single notebook stacking four cheap, all-lecture-prescribed regularization / TTA changes on top of v19.**\n",
    "\n",
    "After v37 (Lian aug, LB 0.7092) failed to transfer, returning to recipe tweaks that come directly from L4 (Learning Process) of the course slides.\n",
    "\n",
    "## What changes vs v19 (LB 0.7455)\n",
    "\n",
    "| Lever | v19 | **v41** | Slide |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `LABEL_SMOOTHING` | 0.0 | **0.05** | L4 p87: *\"If adding blur to the input is useful, why not to the output (true labels) as well? Label smoothing\"* |\n",
    "| `USE_MULTISCALE_TTA` | False | **True** (3 scales × 8 D4 = 24-way) | L4 p82: ResNet-style multiscale + crop TTA |\n",
    "| `DROPOUT` | 0.3 | **0.4** | L4 p88: *\"Probability of dropping is a hyperparameter; 0.5 is common\"* |\n",
    "| **PairedGeoAug** | rotate + flip + small affine | **+ paired RandomResizedCrop(128, scale=(0.85, 1.0))** | L4 p81: ResNet-style random crops & scales |\n",
    "\n",
    "Everything else stays at v19 verbatim — EffNet-B0, MIL loss, AdaBN, paired geo aug, test-stain norm, 12 epochs, AdamW + OneCycleLR, BASE_SEED=1.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Expected outcome\n",
    "\n",
    "These are four small, orthogonal regularization changes. Each typically buys +0.003–0.01 LB AUC individually. If they stack roughly additively we'd expect **+0.01 to +0.025 over v19**, landing around 0.755–0.77. If they interfere or one of them is the wrong choice for our setup (e.g. dropout=0.4 is too aggressive on top of EffNet's internal dropout), we could regress.\n",
    "\n",
    "Worst case: regression of ~0.01-0.02 vs v19, since none of the four changes is fundamentally architecture-altering.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Compute on T4\n",
    "\n",
    "| Stage | Time |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| JPEG cache | ~56 min |\n",
    "| Pixel stats | ~30 s |\n",
    "| Train 12 epochs (~5 min/ep, slightly slower due to crop aug) | ~60 min |\n",
    "| 24-way TTA (3 scales × 8 D4) + AdaBN | ~18 min |\n",
    "| **Total** | **~2h 15min** |\n",
    "\n",
    "About 10 min slower than v19 due to multiscale TTA.\n",
